sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R as ntlmrelayx (same subnet)
  participant DC as DC01 (coerced)
  participant CA as CA RPC (MS-ICPR)
  Note over CA: IF_ENFORCEENCRYPTICERTREQUEST = OFF<br/>ICertPassage accepts unencrypted RPC
  R->>DC: Coerce NTLM
  DC->>R: NTLM (DC01$)
  R->>CA: Relay over RPC (no packet privacy required)
  CA-->>R: Certificate for DC01$
